1
00:01:28,146 --> 00:01:33,055
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:01:35,333 --> 00:01:37,375
Where are you going?

3
00:01:37,375 --> 00:01:39,858
I'll take you to see something interesting.

4
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,741
[Episode 12]

5
00:01:55,739 --> 00:01:59,250
[1990]

6
00:01:59,250 --> 00:02:00,541
Is it really because of him?

7
00:02:00,541 --> 00:02:01,541
You bet it is.

8
00:02:01,541 --> 00:02:02,958
I was in the office the other day,

9
00:02:02,958 --> 00:02:04,916
and I saw his dad kneeling down
begging the dean.

10
00:02:04,916 --> 00:02:06,041
It was no use.

11
00:02:06,041 --> 00:02:07,625
He went too far this time.

12
00:02:07,625 --> 00:02:09,958
Lu Xiao Fan didn't even provoke him.

13
00:02:09,958 --> 00:02:12,191
But he didn't have to be expelled for it.

14
00:02:47,083 --> 00:02:48,916
Don't let me see you around here again.

15
00:02:48,916 --> 00:02:50,708
Of all the people with stalls on this street,

16
00:02:50,708 --> 00:02:53,291
who doesn't pay me the management fee?

17
00:02:53,291 --> 00:02:55,250
Think you're special as a college student?

18
00:02:55,250 --> 00:02:57,900
You're just an expelled one now.

19
00:02:59,958 --> 00:03:01,171
Let's go.

20
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,191
Thank you.

21
00:03:31,166 --> 00:03:33,233
I don't need your pity!

22
00:03:34,291 --> 00:03:35,625
Shen Zhi Qin.

23
00:03:35,625 --> 00:03:38,566
I didn't mean for him to hit you.

24
00:03:40,083 --> 00:03:41,625
I didn't think it would turn out like this.

25
00:03:41,625 --> 00:03:43,275
Get lost!

26
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,108
Shen Zhi Qin.

27
00:03:58,666 --> 00:03:59,704
Shen Zhi Qin!

28
00:03:59,704 --> 00:04:02,375
[Financial Trends]
[90s Financial Revolution]

29
00:04:02,375 --> 00:04:05,066
At least take the magazines back.

30
00:04:10,166 --> 00:04:13,166
You're Zhi Qin's classmate?

31
00:04:13,166 --> 00:04:14,333
Yes.

32
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:15,916
Please, come in.

33
00:04:15,916 --> 00:04:17,691
Hello, sir.

34
00:04:21,291 --> 00:04:23,275
Just leave the stuff and get out.

35
00:04:24,083 --> 00:04:25,166
Zhi Qin.

36
00:04:25,166 --> 00:04:27,041
You always have such a temper.

37
00:04:27,041 --> 00:04:29,666
Why don't you ever learn?

38
00:04:29,666 --> 00:04:31,858
Don't mind him.

39
00:04:33,208 --> 00:04:36,750
You're the first classmate
who's come to visit Zhi Qin.

40
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:39,333
It shows you're a good kid.

41
00:04:39,333 --> 00:04:41,358
What's your name?

42
00:04:43,708 --> 00:04:45,625
Now you know what shame is?

43
00:04:45,625 --> 00:04:47,791
When you were fighting
and bullying your classmate,

44
00:04:47,791 --> 00:04:49,900
why didn't you feel ashamed then?

45
00:04:50,541 --> 00:04:51,541
Sir...

46
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:53,483
My name is Lu Xiao Fan.

47
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:58,041
Back then, Zhi Qin's grades
were always very good.

48
00:04:58,041 --> 00:05:01,500
I don't know why he didn't get into
a top school during the entrance exam.

49
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:04,041
The university happened to be
expanding its vocational enrollment.

50
00:05:04,041 --> 00:05:08,583
That year, a truck crushed this leg of mine.

51
00:05:08,583 --> 00:05:11,833
The compensation money
was just enough to pay for his tuition.

52
00:05:11,833 --> 00:05:13,375
You know how universities are.

53
00:05:13,375 --> 00:05:15,333
They're full of rich kids.

54
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:17,375
Zhi Qin is very competitive.

55
00:05:17,375 --> 00:05:20,166
He always wants to wear nice clothes.

56
00:05:20,166 --> 00:05:22,208
When he's short on money, he works.

57
00:05:22,208 --> 00:05:24,066
He sells magazines.

58
00:05:27,916 --> 00:05:30,041
Xiao Fan.

59
00:05:30,041 --> 00:05:32,333
Don't take it to heart with Zhi Qin.

60
00:05:32,333 --> 00:05:35,041
He's just very proud.

61
00:05:35,041 --> 00:05:36,208
Zhi Qin...

62
00:05:36,208 --> 00:05:37,875
He's not a bad person.

63
00:05:37,875 --> 00:05:41,875
I hope you'll come and visit him often.

64
00:05:41,875 --> 00:05:44,191
I will, Uncle.

65
00:05:49,458 --> 00:05:50,791
- Uncle...
- Xiao Fan.

66
00:05:50,791 --> 00:05:51,833
You've misunderstood me.

67
00:05:51,833 --> 00:05:53,900
I could never take your money.

68
00:05:55,875 --> 00:05:57,458
Who wants your charity?

69
00:05:57,458 --> 00:06:00,400
I'm just paying for these magazines.

70
00:06:20,916 --> 00:06:23,108
<i>I don't need your pity!</i>

71
00:06:33,375 --> 00:06:35,067
Xiao Fan.

72
00:06:35,791 --> 00:06:39,041
Well? Are you satisfied
with how I stood up for you?

73
00:06:39,041 --> 00:06:42,150
Bei Lv Qing hasn't been
this high-profile in all his years at school.

74
00:06:43,416 --> 00:06:46,958
Lu Xiao Fan, can you stop
bringing this junk into the building?

75
00:06:46,958 --> 00:06:50,708
Xiao Fan, there's another
cardboard box over there.

76
00:06:50,708 --> 00:06:52,708
<i>During his school years,</i>

77
00:06:52,708 --> 00:06:55,708
<i>Lu Xiao Fan worked hard to save money.</i>

78
00:06:55,708 --> 00:06:59,083
<i>But he knew that for Shen Zhi Qin,</i>

79
00:06:59,083 --> 00:07:01,291
<i>this help was just a drop in the bucket.</i>

80
00:07:01,291 --> 00:07:04,125
<i>He could only spend more time
with Shen Zhi Qin's father,</i>

81
00:07:04,125 --> 00:07:07,608
<i>even if it was just to chat.</i>

82
00:07:10,250 --> 00:07:11,916
Lu Xiao Fan, have you had enough?

83
00:07:11,916 --> 00:07:14,500
Can't you just get lost?

84
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:15,583
Oh, Zhi Qin!

85
00:07:15,583 --> 00:07:17,166
- You're the one who's had enough!
- Dad!

86
00:07:17,166 --> 00:07:19,566
He's just here to show off.

87
00:07:20,208 --> 00:07:22,333
You've already won, Lu Xiao Fan.

88
00:07:22,333 --> 00:07:24,583
I know I'm not from the same world as you.

89
00:07:24,583 --> 00:07:26,958
You don't have to humiliate me like this.

90
00:07:26,958 --> 00:07:28,125
Sit down!

91
00:07:28,125 --> 00:07:30,858
Xiao Fan has had a hard life, too.

92
00:07:33,458 --> 00:07:36,958
<i>Lu Xiao Fan belongs to a group of people</i>

93
00:07:36,958 --> 00:07:41,041
<i>whose purpose in life
was not the meaning of life,</i>

94
00:07:41,041 --> 00:07:43,500
<i>nor the pursuit of life,</i>

95
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,916
<i>but survival itself.</i>

96
00:07:44,916 --> 00:07:48,458
So, maybe one day,

97
00:07:48,458 --> 00:07:51,900
I'll be thrown back
to my hometown in the mountains.

98
00:07:54,708 --> 00:07:56,291
Don't you hate Bei Lv Qing?

99
00:07:56,291 --> 00:07:58,025
Don't you hate the Bei family?

100
00:08:08,791 --> 00:08:12,875
The most important thing is to survive.

101
00:08:12,875 --> 00:08:16,858
And then strive to live well.

102
00:08:25,166 --> 00:08:27,208
Then how do you think we can survive?

103
00:08:27,208 --> 00:08:28,900
And live well?

104
00:08:55,958 --> 00:08:57,650
Zhi Qin.

105
00:08:59,431 --> 00:09:00,987
Zhi Qin.

106
00:09:17,583 --> 00:09:19,275
Zhi Qin.

107
00:09:22,708 --> 00:09:24,708
I know you secretly
gave the old man a lot of money

108
00:09:24,708 --> 00:09:26,483
to buy medicine.

109
00:09:28,333 --> 00:09:30,441
But that's not your responsibility.

110
00:09:36,958 --> 00:09:38,875
I didn't know it was bone cancer.

111
00:09:38,875 --> 00:09:40,858
None of you told me.

112
00:09:42,958 --> 00:09:46,941
What if there was another way?

113
00:09:52,208 --> 00:09:53,816
Zhi Qin.

114
00:09:54,541 --> 00:09:56,733
What are your plans for the future?

115
00:09:58,791 --> 00:10:01,125
You're right.

116
00:10:01,125 --> 00:10:03,375
China's future lies in the economy.

117
00:10:03,375 --> 00:10:05,233
I believe you.

118
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:08,875
So, I'm planning to sell this ancestral house.

119
00:10:08,875 --> 00:10:10,083
I'll go out and make a name for myself.

120
00:10:10,083 --> 00:10:12,500
This house is the last thing you have.

121
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:14,958
You're really going to sell it?

122
00:10:14,958 --> 00:10:17,400
I'll definitely make something of myself.

123
00:10:18,708 --> 00:10:20,566
What I want,

124
00:10:21,458 --> 00:10:24,066
I must earn for myself.

125
00:10:31,041 --> 00:10:33,607
Xiao Fan is here. Sit down.

126
00:10:33,607 --> 00:10:35,041
[Document Folder]

127
00:10:38,541 --> 00:10:40,375
This guy doesn't even have an account.

128
00:10:40,375 --> 00:10:43,275
Why the hell is he reading
the securities paper all day?

129
00:10:51,412 --> 00:10:56,070
[Securities Paper]

130
00:11:03,042 --> 00:11:06,125
- Hello?
<i>- Xiao Fan, it's me.</i>

131
00:11:06,125 --> 00:11:08,858
<i>- Is it a good time to talk?</i>
- Yes, it's fine.

132
00:11:10,083 --> 00:11:11,416
Did you lose money again?

133
00:11:11,416 --> 00:11:13,458
<i>Actually, I didn't.</i>

134
00:11:13,458 --> 00:11:15,833
<i>It's just that it keeps going up.</i>

135
00:11:15,833 --> 00:11:18,750
<i>I don't know if I should sell.</i>

136
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:22,375
You didn't invest all your money, did you?

137
00:11:22,375 --> 00:11:24,041
<i>Yeah.</i>

138
00:11:24,041 --> 00:11:27,500
<i>Maybe I should sell some to pay the rent.</i>

139
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:31,125
The price of rice is going to rise.

140
00:11:31,125 --> 00:11:32,666
Rice is going up?

141
00:11:32,666 --> 00:11:35,525
Wheat will probably be the same.

142
00:11:36,958 --> 00:11:40,333
I've seen it in the newspapers lately, too.

143
00:11:40,333 --> 00:11:44,208
I think there's still room for it to rise.

144
00:11:44,208 --> 00:11:46,025
Hang in there.

145
00:11:46,833 --> 00:11:50,166
<i>Is your address the same? I'll send you an IOU.</i>

146
00:11:50,166 --> 00:11:52,250
- There's really no need.
<i>- Keep the IOU.</i>

147
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:54,775
<i>I, Shen Zhi Qin, will definitely pay you back.</i>

148
00:12:10,166 --> 00:12:11,459
You're finally here.

149
00:12:11,459 --> 00:12:14,083
Hey, Xiao Fan.

150
00:12:14,083 --> 00:12:16,833
This is your fiancé Bei Lv Qing's...

151
00:12:16,833 --> 00:12:18,525
brother-in-law.

152
00:12:20,541 --> 00:12:21,791
Hello.

153
00:12:21,791 --> 00:12:23,750
I'm Bei Lv Qing's...

154
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:25,441
brother-in-law.

155
00:12:26,333 --> 00:12:31,125
<i>Over the next few years,
Shen Zhi Qin's business boomed.</i>

156
00:12:31,125 --> 00:12:33,083
<i>After Xiao Fan came to Lin Gang,</i>

157
00:12:33,083 --> 00:12:34,416
<i>behind Bei Lv Qing's back,</i>

158
00:12:34,416 --> 00:12:37,566
<i>he thrived in the securities market.</i>

159
00:12:38,791 --> 00:12:41,316
What's so important
that we had to meet in person?

160
00:12:44,083 --> 00:12:46,150
A lovers' quarrel?

161
00:12:47,083 --> 00:12:50,333
- If Bei Lv Qing knew you were here...
- Li Wen Xi.

162
00:12:50,333 --> 00:12:53,358
Did he go to your office today?

163
00:12:57,333 --> 00:12:59,250
Li Wen Xi is teaming up with Lu Tao

164
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:01,275
to take down Bei Lv Qing.

165
00:13:04,458 --> 00:13:07,025
You're just going to tell me that easily?

166
00:13:09,916 --> 00:13:12,608
He only proposed the idea today.

167
00:13:13,458 --> 00:13:15,791
I would've told you even if you didn't ask.

168
00:13:15,791 --> 00:13:18,150
I know I owe you, Lu Xiao Fan.

169
00:13:24,291 --> 00:13:26,316
Maybe I shouldn't have told you.

170
00:13:27,416 --> 00:13:29,875
I think you hate Bei Lv Qing.

171
00:13:29,875 --> 00:13:32,941
Now that I've told you,
it's become your burden.

172
00:13:38,041 --> 00:13:40,291
You decide for yourself.

173
00:13:40,291 --> 00:13:43,083
If you hate the man, then don't say a word.

174
00:13:43,083 --> 00:13:46,875
If you don't hate him,
tell him Li Wen Xi is coming after him.

175
00:13:46,875 --> 00:13:48,691
I don't hate him.

176
00:13:51,833 --> 00:13:53,525
But I...

177
00:13:54,166 --> 00:13:57,250
really want to hate him.

178
00:13:57,250 --> 00:13:59,900
And I really want him to hate me.

179
00:14:00,625 --> 00:14:03,166
Then don't tell him.

180
00:14:03,166 --> 00:14:04,792
But...

181
00:14:04,792 --> 00:14:07,442
Li Wen Xi can't handle my brother.

182
00:14:08,250 --> 00:14:10,566
Even with Lu Tao, they can't.

183
00:14:11,791 --> 00:14:14,666
Don't overestimate Bei Lv Qing.

184
00:14:14,666 --> 00:14:17,208
Li Wen Xi has capital and is ruthless.

185
00:14:17,208 --> 00:14:20,208
Why wouldn't he be able to handle it?

186
00:14:20,208 --> 00:14:23,083
Just wait for Bei Lv Qing to go broke.

187
00:14:23,083 --> 00:14:25,083
Last time Lu Tao and I were chatting,

188
00:14:25,083 --> 00:14:27,333
he mentioned a possibility.

189
00:14:27,333 --> 00:14:30,000
That is, if they could find out

190
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,750
what futures my brother bought,

191
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:34,583
and how many lots,

192
00:14:34,583 --> 00:14:36,816
and at what point he opens positions,

193
00:14:37,583 --> 00:14:39,041
they might be able to

194
00:14:39,041 --> 00:14:42,041
use limited funds in a short period of time

195
00:14:42,041 --> 00:14:44,583
to make my brother's account blow up.

196
00:14:44,583 --> 00:14:46,000
Oh?

197
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,833
He's not just talking about a possibility.

198
00:14:48,833 --> 00:14:51,625
Actually, he's always wanted to do that.

199
00:14:51,625 --> 00:14:54,416
He wants my brother to feel
what it's like to plummet

200
00:14:54,416 --> 00:14:56,358
and have nothing left.

201
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,358
To feel how you felt back then.

202
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:04,875
What does that have to do with me?

203
00:15:04,875 --> 00:15:07,625
The futures market is a place
where the big fish eat the small fish.

204
00:15:07,625 --> 00:15:10,083
Everyone who enters the market is a fish.

205
00:15:10,083 --> 00:15:12,041
It just so happens that
Bei Lv Qing is a big, fat fish.

206
00:15:12,041 --> 00:15:14,650
It's not surprising that Lu Tao targeted him.

207
00:15:15,375 --> 00:15:18,916
If Lu Tao could accurately know

208
00:15:18,916 --> 00:15:21,208
what kind of futures my brother bought,

209
00:15:21,208 --> 00:15:22,708
how many lots,

210
00:15:22,708 --> 00:15:24,858
and at what point he adds to his positions,

211
00:15:26,375 --> 00:15:29,691
could you and him make my brother go broke?

212
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:33,316
Are you serious?

213
00:15:35,083 --> 00:15:37,400
Is my brother still playing games?

214
00:15:40,333 --> 00:15:42,541
You mean Lu Xiao Ping?

215
00:15:42,541 --> 00:15:44,875
It doesn't seem like Bei Lv Qing

216
00:15:44,875 --> 00:15:48,233
is doing your brother a favor
by letting him learn the ropes.

217
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:52,416
He probably just wants
your brother around to play games.

218
00:15:52,416 --> 00:15:54,458
The young master has plenty of money.

219
00:15:54,458 --> 00:15:55,875
Spending over 10,000 a month

220
00:15:55,875 --> 00:15:57,625
to see your brother so smug...

221
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:59,816
It's worth it just for the fun.

222
00:16:04,791 --> 00:16:07,250
Lv Qing is not that shallow.

223
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:08,833
He never trusted Li Wen Xi.

224
00:16:08,833 --> 00:16:10,900
Goodness...

225
00:16:18,375 --> 00:16:21,650
I didn't know you and Wen Xi were so close.

226
00:16:22,291 --> 00:16:24,275
We're childhood friends.

227
00:16:25,041 --> 00:16:27,275
No wonder you're doing business together.

228
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:31,316
Isn't this all for you?

229
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,775
Be careful.

230
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,875
What's wrong?

231
00:16:52,875 --> 00:16:54,041
Nothing.

232
00:16:54,041 --> 00:16:56,153
- Let's go inside.
- Okay.

233
00:16:58,541 --> 00:17:00,708
Xiao Fan found out?

234
00:17:00,708 --> 00:17:03,191
Then you have to explain it to him.

235
00:17:05,583 --> 00:17:08,500
Li Wen Xi went to see Lu Xiao Fan today.

236
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,816
What does Li Wen Xi know?

237
00:17:12,916 --> 00:17:14,666
He probably doesn't know yet.

238
00:17:14,666 --> 00:17:16,833
But I don't dare tell Xiao Fan.

239
00:17:16,833 --> 00:17:19,733
I'm afraid Li Wen Xi will fish for information.

240
00:17:20,708 --> 00:17:22,666
Then...

241
00:17:22,666 --> 00:17:24,958
Then Lu Xiao Fan will be so heartbroken.

242
00:17:24,958 --> 00:17:26,832
Why did it have to be Song Qian Yu?

243
00:17:26,832 --> 00:17:27,834
Anyone else would have done the job.

244
00:17:27,834 --> 00:17:29,916
Why did it have to be Li Wen Xi's friend?

245
00:17:29,916 --> 00:17:33,625
Th-This is like stabbing Xiao Fan in the heart.

246
00:17:33,625 --> 00:17:35,375
Li Wen Xi is very smart.

247
00:17:35,375 --> 00:17:37,083
If it wasn't from his friend,

248
00:17:37,083 --> 00:17:39,941
he wouldn't believe the information.

249
00:17:41,166 --> 00:17:43,525
After all this is over,

250
00:17:44,250 --> 00:17:46,000
I'll tell Xiao Fan everything.

251
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,900
I trust him.

252
00:17:58,500 --> 00:17:59,750
Xiao Fan.

253
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:01,791
I might have to go back to Yunjing.

254
00:18:01,791 --> 00:18:04,041
I'll be back after the New Year.

255
00:18:04,041 --> 00:18:05,500
Uncle.

256
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,125
I have to go back to Lin Gang.

257
00:18:07,125 --> 00:18:08,500
I'll take my leave now.

258
00:18:08,500 --> 00:18:11,125
Do you have urgent business in Lin Gang?

259
00:18:11,125 --> 00:18:13,858
What if Bei Lv Xin doesn't want a divorce?

260
00:18:14,958 --> 00:18:16,750
What will you do?

261
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:19,125
What else can I do?

262
00:18:19,125 --> 00:18:21,733
Then don't bring up the divorce.

263
00:18:36,167 --> 00:18:39,083
<i>Since he moved to Lin Gang,</i>

264
00:18:39,083 --> 00:18:40,708
<i>you've been doing the cleaning?</i>

265
00:18:40,708 --> 00:18:43,208
<i>I know exactly what is kept where.</i>

266
00:18:43,208 --> 00:18:45,608
<i>I'll never misplace anything.</i>

267
00:18:46,416 --> 00:18:48,875
Our housekeeper has very good habits.

268
00:18:48,875 --> 00:18:51,375
She never touches things randomly.

269
00:18:51,375 --> 00:18:55,125
Things stay exactly where they are put.

270
00:18:55,125 --> 00:18:57,166
But my brother isn't that stupid.

271
00:18:57,166 --> 00:19:00,441
You have to use Li Wen Xi as bait first.

272
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:03,375
Bei Lv Qing is the best, all right?

273
00:19:03,375 --> 00:19:06,291
- Can you stop repeating that?
- I trust Xiao Fan's judgment.

274
00:19:06,291 --> 00:19:08,208
Look.

275
00:19:08,208 --> 00:19:11,208
The micro-camera is inside here.

276
00:19:11,208 --> 00:19:13,625
But are you sure

277
00:19:13,625 --> 00:19:16,025
we'll definitely receive the signal?

278
00:19:19,208 --> 00:19:21,416
Bei Lv Qing's planned trades...

279
00:19:21,416 --> 00:19:24,458
Only the last one might be the real one.

280
00:19:24,458 --> 00:19:26,708
If you can't guarantee it stays

281
00:19:26,708 --> 00:19:29,625
right where Bei Lv Qing sits,

282
00:19:29,625 --> 00:19:32,066
then we won't see anything.

283
00:19:35,166 --> 00:19:36,231
How about this?

284
00:19:36,231 --> 00:19:39,208
When you get abroad,
give me your account details.

285
00:19:39,208 --> 00:19:40,333
Once the job is done,

286
00:19:40,333 --> 00:19:43,208
I'll transfer your commission for this job.

287
00:19:43,208 --> 00:19:47,566
I'm sure you'll live
a very comfortable life abroad.

288
00:19:50,791 --> 00:19:52,483
No need.

289
00:19:53,958 --> 00:19:55,750
Zhi Qin.

290
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:58,000
Close out all my accounts.

291
00:19:58,000 --> 00:20:00,708
I want to withdraw all the money.

292
00:20:00,708 --> 00:20:03,166
Are you sure you want to close them?

293
00:20:03,166 --> 00:20:06,000
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

294
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:09,483
The millions you made from corn
could turn into tens of millions.

295
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:14,733
One more thing.

296
00:20:16,041 --> 00:20:17,916
After you finish this job,

297
00:20:17,916 --> 00:20:19,333
find a way to escape immediately.

298
00:20:19,333 --> 00:20:21,500
You're overthinking it.

299
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:24,333
Do you really think they're all-powerful?

300
00:20:24,333 --> 00:20:28,208
Besides, the Songnan Gang
and the Yunjing group are fighting fiercely.

301
00:20:28,208 --> 00:20:30,041
We have people backing us up.

302
00:20:30,041 --> 00:20:33,833
Taking down Bei Lv Qing first is just a way
to show respect to those above.

303
00:20:33,833 --> 00:20:36,000
Even if the CSRC regulates the futures market,

304
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:39,292
it's not necessarily up to
Bei Lv Qing's father to decide.

305
00:20:39,292 --> 00:20:40,625
Mr. Lu.

306
00:20:40,625 --> 00:20:42,583
Promise me.

307
00:20:42,583 --> 00:20:44,041
After this job is done,

308
00:20:44,041 --> 00:20:46,608
take Zhi Qin and leave the north.

309
00:20:48,417 --> 00:20:50,109
Otherwise...

310
00:20:51,208 --> 00:20:52,941
I'll back out.

311
00:20:56,875 --> 00:20:58,442
Fine.

312
00:20:59,350 --> 00:21:01,041
I promise.

313
00:21:12,458 --> 00:21:14,375
Zhi Qin.

314
00:21:14,375 --> 00:21:18,441
If Lu Tao doesn't leave, you must leave.

315
00:21:19,208 --> 00:21:21,000
Xiao Fan, trust me.

316
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,833
Bei Lv Qing isn't that capable.

317
00:21:23,833 --> 00:21:28,625
Actually, even if we pull this off,

318
00:21:28,625 --> 00:21:31,150
it won't truly destroy him.

319
00:21:31,791 --> 00:21:34,333
Then why are you doing all this?

320
00:21:34,333 --> 00:21:36,275
You're not even taking the money.

321
00:21:37,625 --> 00:21:41,375
But it will definitely be a huge blow to him.

322
00:21:41,375 --> 00:21:44,375
He has never failed in his life.

323
00:21:44,375 --> 00:21:49,275
This failure will surely stay with him forever.

324
00:21:50,625 --> 00:21:52,983
- So, you're doing it to...
- I don't know.

325
00:21:53,667 --> 00:21:58,192
Maybe I just want him to remember me.

326
00:22:01,125 --> 00:22:03,416
I don't expect anything

327
00:22:03,416 --> 00:22:05,791
to happen between us in this lifetime.

328
00:22:05,791 --> 00:22:07,566
I just hope

329
00:22:08,291 --> 00:22:10,775
he remembers me for the rest of his life.

330
00:22:12,041 --> 00:22:14,525
Even if it's with hatred.

331
00:22:36,833 --> 00:22:38,291
Lv Qing.

332
00:22:38,291 --> 00:22:39,625
Isn't this too risky?

333
00:22:39,625 --> 00:22:42,375
After all, Li Wen Xi is no small player.

334
00:22:42,375 --> 00:22:45,625
You were the one who persuaded me
to enter this market.

335
00:22:45,625 --> 00:22:48,083
Why are you the one getting cold feet now?

336
00:22:48,083 --> 00:22:50,500
Lv Qing, you've never been such a risk-taker.

337
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:52,400
What's going on with you?

338
00:22:57,250 --> 00:23:00,833
Lu Xiao Fan is determined
to divorce Bei Lv Xin.

339
00:23:00,833 --> 00:23:03,025
What are you talking about?

340
00:23:04,167 --> 00:23:06,359
I'm going to marry Lu Xiao Fan.

341
00:23:07,500 --> 00:23:09,791
Bei Lv Qing, are you crazy?

342
00:23:09,791 --> 00:23:11,708
Your parents will never...

343
00:23:11,708 --> 00:23:13,875
Only this way will I have the leverage

344
00:23:13,875 --> 00:23:16,525
to properly protect Lu Xiao Fan.

345
00:23:29,041 --> 00:23:30,541
It's hard to explain.

346
00:23:30,541 --> 00:23:32,816
That's why I asked them to take a look.

347
00:23:40,500 --> 00:23:42,150
What?

348
00:23:42,916 --> 00:23:44,650
Why did the potato price go up?

349
00:23:46,958 --> 00:23:48,708
It's Lu Xiao Fan.

350
00:23:48,708 --> 00:23:52,750
<i>Attention all passengers
for flight YG1213 bound for Porto.</i>

351
00:23:52,750 --> 00:23:54,000
<i>Your flight is now boarding.</i>

352
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,708
<i>Lu Xiao Fan didn't think for a second</i>

353
00:23:55,708 --> 00:23:58,500
<i>that he could take down Bei Lv Qing in one go.</i>

354
00:23:58,500 --> 00:24:01,166
<i>He wasn't as optimistic
as Lu Tao and Shen Zhi Qin.</i>

355
00:24:01,166 --> 00:24:04,583
<i>He was fleeing with a sense
of desperate urgency,</i>

356
00:24:04,583 --> 00:24:07,708
<i>knowing full well he would never return.</i>

357
00:24:07,708 --> 00:24:09,416
<i>If it weren't for Bei Lv Qing,</i>

358
00:24:09,416 --> 00:24:13,041
<i>Lu Xiao Fan might have been
an ordinary farmer like his father.</i>

359
00:24:13,041 --> 00:24:16,291
<i>He wouldn't be this kind,
nor would he be this bad.</i>

360
00:24:16,291 --> 00:24:20,041
<i>He'd have a hardworking,
feisty wife just like his mother.</i>

361
00:24:20,041 --> 00:24:23,083
<i>They'd have one child, and then two more.</i>

362
00:24:23,083 --> 00:24:25,666
<i>A life of poverty, but lively.</i>

363
00:24:25,666 --> 00:24:28,125
<i>Lu Xiao Fan didn't hate
that he had become twisted.</i>

364
00:24:28,125 --> 00:24:32,083
<i>But he hated that
he was twisted and yet all alone.</i>

365
00:24:32,083 --> 00:24:33,916
<i>He didn't want to hate his mother,</i>

366
00:24:33,916 --> 00:24:36,000
<i>nor was he willing to hate Lu Xiao Ping.</i>

367
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:38,125
<i>He certainly wouldn't hate Bei Lv Xin.</i>

368
00:24:38,125 --> 00:24:41,166
<i>But he had to hate the man</i>

369
00:24:41,166 --> 00:24:43,833
<i>who gave him dreams time and again,
only to snatch them away.</i>

370
00:24:43,833 --> 00:24:47,416
<i>When he thought of that man,
he felt nothing but hate.</i>

371
00:24:47,416 --> 00:24:49,375
<i>His legs would tremble at the thought.</i>

372
00:24:49,375 --> 00:24:51,375
<i>When he thought of that man,</i>

373
00:24:51,375 --> 00:24:53,875
<i>he couldn't stop thinking of him.</i>

374
00:24:53,875 --> 00:24:56,858
<i>He wanted the man to remember him forever.</i>

375
00:25:38,958 --> 00:25:41,442
<i>Hello? Who is this?</i>

376
00:25:42,666 --> 00:25:44,541
<i>If you don't speak, I'm hanging up.</i>

377
00:25:44,541 --> 00:25:46,983
Zhi Qin, it's me.

378
00:25:48,250 --> 00:25:50,416
It's me, Lu Xiao Fan.

379
00:25:50,416 --> 00:25:52,191
You...

380
00:26:08,529 --> 00:26:16,467
[Shen Zhi Qin]

381
00:26:26,583 --> 00:26:30,000
Mr. Lu Tao, you are officially
under arrest for disrupting the market.

382
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:32,025
Please come with us.

383
00:26:37,208 --> 00:26:39,500
I did it all by myself.

384
00:26:39,500 --> 00:26:41,858
It had nothing to do with anyone else.

385
00:26:51,031 --> 00:26:53,154
[Lu Tao was sentenced to five years
of imprisonment for market disruption.]

386
00:26:53,154 --> 00:26:55,357
[Bei Lv Qing was investigated and his earnings
from illegal investments confiscated.]

387
00:27:00,070 --> 00:27:04,611
[Spain, 1996]
[Chinatown]

388
00:27:09,958 --> 00:27:12,125
What can I get for you?

389
00:27:12,125 --> 00:27:13,958
I'll have one bone soup...

390
00:27:13,958 --> 00:27:16,666
and one seafood porridge.

391
00:27:16,666 --> 00:27:18,416
Sure.

392
00:27:18,416 --> 00:27:20,250
No spring onions, please.

393
00:27:20,250 --> 00:27:22,608
Would you like some celery, then?

394
00:27:37,083 --> 00:27:39,042
Tell me, are you really that stupid?

395
00:27:39,042 --> 00:27:41,542
You used your Portuguese account
to wire money to Shen Zhi Qin.

396
00:27:41,542 --> 00:27:43,791
You're basically telling us
exactly where you are.

397
00:27:43,791 --> 00:27:45,650
Why even bother running?

398
00:27:48,333 --> 00:27:50,400
He started it.

399
00:27:53,125 --> 00:27:56,775
The way you chose to make me
remember you is truly unique.

400
00:27:58,639 --> 00:28:00,851
I say, Lv Qing, why don't we
stop wasting our breath?

401
00:28:00,851 --> 00:28:02,835
Let's just kill him.

402
00:28:04,875 --> 00:28:06,900
Where are my soup and porridge?

403
00:28:10,833 --> 00:28:13,566
Big Bro, here's the porridge.

404
00:28:22,250 --> 00:28:23,875
I say, Lu Xiao Fan,

405
00:28:23,875 --> 00:28:27,041
first, you nearly bankrupted us
and gave us a real scare.

406
00:28:27,041 --> 00:28:29,375
Then you made us exhausted
from searching for you.

407
00:28:29,375 --> 00:28:32,541
Now you're acting all friendly with us.

408
00:28:32,541 --> 00:28:34,750
But have you thought about it?

409
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:36,458
You've offended so many people...

410
00:28:36,458 --> 00:28:38,775
and caused such a huge mess.

411
00:28:39,500 --> 00:28:42,900
How do you think your family is doing now?

412
00:28:44,417 --> 00:28:46,083
Big Bro...

413
00:28:46,083 --> 00:28:48,566
Is what Zi Yang said true?

414
00:28:50,166 --> 00:28:51,583
Your brother might not pursue it,

415
00:28:51,583 --> 00:28:54,400
but that doesn't mean the others won't.

416
00:29:00,375 --> 00:29:02,208
A man should answer for his own actions.

417
00:29:02,208 --> 00:29:03,875
I'll take responsibility for my own mess.

418
00:29:03,875 --> 00:29:06,191
Lu Xiao Fan, calm down.

419
00:29:18,416 --> 00:29:20,608
Let's get married.

420
00:29:24,708 --> 00:29:26,545
You really are a piece of work.

421
00:29:26,545 --> 00:29:28,333
I was just teasing you,
and you took it seriously.

422
00:29:28,333 --> 00:29:30,000
If we were really seeking revenge,

423
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,708
would we be wasting our time here with you?

424
00:29:31,708 --> 00:29:33,525
I really...

425
00:29:35,917 --> 00:29:38,083
Big Bro...

426
00:29:38,083 --> 00:29:39,583
Weren't you...

427
00:29:39,583 --> 00:29:42,458
supposed to be getting engaged?

428
00:29:42,458 --> 00:29:45,083
If Lv Qing didn't need to
make enough money to run away with you,

429
00:29:45,083 --> 00:29:47,542
why else would he agree to trade futures?

430
00:29:47,542 --> 00:29:50,728
He only played nice with that woman
to fool his mom and Li Wen Xi for a few days.

431
00:29:50,728 --> 00:29:52,583
You've got quite a temper.

432
00:29:52,583 --> 00:29:55,583
You nearly made us lose our minds
playing along with you.

433
00:29:55,583 --> 00:29:58,875
Even my old man's secret stash
was almost blown because of you.

434
00:29:58,875 --> 00:30:03,025
If you hadn't run so fast, you'd be dead meat.

435
00:30:18,750 --> 00:30:20,775
Your cooking hasn't changed.

436
00:30:22,458 --> 00:30:27,066
You'll have to make porridge for me
for the rest of your life.

437
00:30:29,041 --> 00:30:31,066
Are you willing?

438
00:30:42,083 --> 00:30:44,066
I am.

439
00:31:05,208 --> 00:31:06,900
Let's go.

440
00:31:51,906 --> 00:31:53,865
Bei Lv Qing, do you take

441
00:31:53,865 --> 00:31:55,789
Lu Xiao Fan to be your partner?

442
00:31:55,789 --> 00:31:58,667
In the presence of God,
to love and cherish him,

443
00:31:58,667 --> 00:32:02,000
to be faithful and caring of him,

444
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:05,542
to respect him in health and sickness,

445
00:32:05,542 --> 00:32:09,093
until the end of your life?

446
00:32:11,289 --> 00:32:13,539
I will.

447
00:32:13,539 --> 00:32:17,375
Lu Xiao Fan, do you take
Bei Lv Qing as your partner?

448
00:32:17,375 --> 00:32:20,978
In the presence of God,
to love and cherish him,

449
00:32:20,978 --> 00:32:23,292
in health and sickness, to respect...

450
00:32:23,292 --> 00:32:24,916
I will!

451
00:32:26,583 --> 00:32:27,856
Congratulations.

452
00:32:27,856 --> 00:32:30,048
You may now kiss each other.

453
00:33:07,542 --> 00:33:09,497
<i>Lu Xiao Fan.</i>

454
00:33:09,497 --> 00:33:11,189
<i>I've realized...</i>

455
00:33:11,997 --> 00:33:14,647
<i>this is the first time
I've looked at you like this.</i>

456
00:33:45,917 --> 00:33:47,442
Big Bro.

457
00:34:04,164 --> 00:34:06,939
Why are you up before the alarm went off?

458
00:34:08,747 --> 00:34:09,955
Big Bro.

459
00:34:09,955 --> 00:34:13,458
You need to remove
the tough fibers from the celery.

460
00:34:13,458 --> 00:34:15,450
Otherwise, they'll get stuck in your teeth.

461
00:34:22,750 --> 00:34:24,086
Like this.

462
00:34:25,289 --> 00:34:26,980
Then you do it.

463
00:34:37,580 --> 00:34:41,122
Oh, and boil the water before adding the rice.

464
00:34:41,122 --> 00:34:43,230
Otherwise, it'll stick to the pot.

465
00:34:47,205 --> 00:34:50,939
Also, the rice should be soaked in advance.

466
00:34:52,542 --> 00:34:55,192
That way, it'll cook until it's soft.

467
00:34:57,705 --> 00:35:01,247
It seems I'll have to work a bit harder then.

468
00:35:01,247 --> 00:35:03,997
Just tell me what you want to eat.

469
00:35:03,997 --> 00:35:05,730
I'll cook it.

470
00:35:09,789 --> 00:35:13,080
If I had worked a bit harder last night,

471
00:35:13,080 --> 00:35:15,605
you wouldn't have so much to say today.

472
00:35:23,955 --> 00:35:26,372
Let's go to France for New Year's.

473
00:35:26,372 --> 00:35:29,564
We'll see the Eiffel Tower
you've always dreamed of.

474
00:35:32,580 --> 00:35:35,747
Big Bro, I have something to tell you.

475
00:35:35,747 --> 00:35:37,622
Don't be mad.

476
00:35:37,622 --> 00:35:39,580
All right.

477
00:35:39,580 --> 00:35:41,455
My mom said...

478
00:35:41,455 --> 00:35:45,939
she wants us to go home together
for the New Year.

479
00:36:05,289 --> 00:36:07,480
My mom said...

480
00:36:08,625 --> 00:36:12,000
newlyweds have to pay respects
to their ancestors together

481
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,442
to be truly recognized.

482
00:36:20,167 --> 00:36:21,775
Okay.

